/-!
# The Lyons model interface

`Lyons.LyonsGroup` is the subgroup generated by the two explicit ATLAS matrices
in dimension 111 over `ZMod 5`. The construction, finiteness and nonabelian
certification are re-exported here. The order and simplicity certificates belong
in extension modules over `Atlas111Group`, to be assembled at this interface.

Source: ATLAS of Finite Group Representations, `LyG1-f5r111B0`;
see `Atlas111Source/README.md` for the exact data and references.
-/
